  "title": "7:15P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-2",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "e7555a00efc053fa430f54a411835364d29ff59055625a8ca2f99dbe189ba663",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "*Cough cough* Everybody okay?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Just managed to block it——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Nice reflexes, you two.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Whew, they really blew it up, didn't they?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "————*indescribable penguin sounds*————",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "(Wh- what's that? Baws's makin' all kinds of crazy sounds!)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "(Hey, wasn't that box of vinyl records some kind of black market Columbian collectible thingy?)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "(I reckon yer right. What're we gonna do? I ain't never seen the baws all choked up like this before...)",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "What do you mean—— Hey! They're getting away! Those guys in black!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Wait! If they were here setting that trap, why didn't they just ambush us? This isn't adding up. We need to take a minute and come up with a plan before——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Texas!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Get in.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "...Listen up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "You can expense your speeding tickets tonight.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "They gotta pay... for my vinyl recoooords!!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Got 'em! Dead ahead!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "Exusiai! Pass me my Lil Homie!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "You got it, boss!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Is that a gun?! But how are you going to pull the trigger...?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "Hah! See for yourself, little man. Let our firearms expert tell you about it.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "That's forty-two layers of logistics-grade cardboard, seamlessly glued together with industrial adhesive, driven by the finest rubber bands. It's really a magnificent piece.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "You mean... it's a toy?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "It's more of a slingshot——Ow! Err, it's a peacemaker!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "You can't use live ammo in downtown Lungmen. That's the law.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "And yet this is the only time the boss seems to care what the law says.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "If nobody follows the rules, our whole society goes to hell, you feel me? Texas, put the top down!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Be careful. Don't want you hitting your head on a traffic signal like last time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "Do I look that tall to you?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Support sniper in position, boss!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "W- wait a minute, there's a lot of other cars on the road. Don't tell me you're just gonna——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafia Driver",
      "text": "They're shootin' at us! Return fire!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Back Seat Mafioso",
      "text": "How am I supposed to aim with you swervin' all over the place?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafia Driver",
      "text": "Hey, are you hit back there?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Back Seat Mafioso",
      "text": "I'm bleeding, they got me, I need a bandage—— No wait, what is this, rubber?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafia Driver",
      "text": "A what?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Back Seat Mafioso",
      "text": "It's rubber, but it broke the glass! Shake 'em off, quick! Gah, that hurt!!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Clean headshot, boss!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "Sic 'em, Texas!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "I'm speeding up.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Slow down! Watch out for that big rig—— Aie!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Yer gonna wanna hold on tight. Texas's whipped up wilder'n a Forte in a twister right now.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "Exu, blow their tires!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "On it!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "She's gonna pop their tires with rubber bullets?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Emperor",
      "text": "I have spoken. So let it be done.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Texas, can you talk some sense into them?!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "(Looks away) ......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "text": "Forget it. They're havin' a good time.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Check this out! It's gonna do a cool flip!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafia Driver",
      "text": "Hey, I can't move the steering wheel!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Back Seat Mafioso",
      "text": "Shit, bail out!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "text": "Wait! Going this fast, we're gonna get pulled in!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "Hah.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "text": "All right, now the multi-car pileup is all yours, Texas!",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "text": "Gee, thanks a lot.",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
